WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
video file & English subtitles: Safex
fixed by fofiko1 and Rémi

00:00:03.998 --> 00:00:08.127
Candy believed
that the kind and young Arthur

00:00:08.277 --> 00:00:11.569
was not a murderer at all.

00:00:15.309 --> 00:00:16.936
Two tithingmen came to arrest Arthur.

00:00:17.086 --> 00:00:25.146
Dr. Kerry hurried her way
through the rain to save Arthur.

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:32.353
Yet another murderer.

00:00:42.036 --> 00:00:44.300
Candy! Candy!

00:00:51.479 --> 00:00:54.243
What is it, Kurin, don't scare me!

00:00:54.749 --> 00:00:57.081
Arthur! I am coming.

00:01:00.221 --> 00:01:02.412
What's wrong?

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:04.787
Candy, McKinley...

00:01:05.359 --> 00:01:07.053
Got worse?

00:01:07.203 --> 00:01:08.321
He is gone.

00:01:08.471 --> 00:01:11.160
I will get changed.

00:01:22.009 --> 00:01:24.034
McKinley!

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:28.746
McKinley!

00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:32.311
Where is he?
He has not recovered yet.

00:01:32.461 --> 00:01:33.717
Candy!

00:01:37.425 --> 00:01:38.951
He is not with Mr. Nelson.

00:01:39.101 --> 00:01:40.520
How about the tunnel?

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:42.121
No, I went there.

00:01:42.271 --> 00:01:44.187
Try the railway.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:57.869
McKinley! McKinley!

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:02.508
That's awful.
Mr. Nelson is going to get angry.

00:02:02.658 --> 00:02:04.644
But it's not your fault.

00:02:04.794 --> 00:02:07.051
But I didn't pay enough attention...

00:02:11.359 --> 00:02:13.224
What's wrong, Kurin?

00:02:17.265 --> 00:02:18.698
Where?

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:21.295
It's McKinley!

00:02:22.069 --> 00:02:23.730
McKinley!

00:02:27.308 --> 00:02:29.105
Where have you been, McKinley?

00:02:29.977 --> 00:02:32.844
Strange. What is he biting?

00:02:34.949 --> 00:02:38.612
This is... It's Sister's brooch!

00:02:39.821 --> 00:02:41.584
Doctor Kerry?

00:02:42.023 --> 00:02:44.583
It's a birthday present I gave her.

00:02:45.092 --> 00:02:47.219
McKinley, where did you find it?

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:53.362
Perhaps sister hurried her way
through the rain last night.

00:02:55.403 --> 00:02:57.564
Do you know where my sister is?

00:02:57.839 --> 00:02:59.397
Take us to her.

00:03:10.785 --> 00:03:13.083
Sister!

00:03:13.487 --> 00:03:15.751
Dr. Kerry!

00:03:21.429 --> 00:03:23.454
You found this here, McKinley?

00:03:27.969 --> 00:03:30.904
If she fell from here,
she would have killed herself!

00:03:35.243 --> 00:03:36.335
Be careful, Candy.

00:03:36.485 --> 00:03:39.345
That's all right, I am used to it.

00:03:42.583 --> 00:03:44.141
Sister!

00:03:52.126 --> 00:03:53.889
She is here.

00:03:55.563 --> 00:03:56.928
Sister!

00:03:57.798 --> 00:03:59.265
Dr. Kerry!

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:03.402
Sister, sister, it's me!

00:04:04.839 --> 00:04:06.966
Candy, sister...

00:04:10.044 --> 00:04:11.604
She just passed out.

00:04:11.754 --> 00:04:14.540
Sister, it's me, Arthur!

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:16.809
Bring her to the clinic.

00:04:16.959 --> 00:04:18.852
OK, I will carry her.

00:04:19.787 --> 00:04:21.414
Is that OK, Arthur?

00:04:21.564 --> 00:04:24.481
That's all right.

00:04:24.725 --> 00:04:27.023
McKinley, go get someone to help!

00:04:35.603 --> 00:04:36.529
Don't just stand there!

00:04:36.679 --> 00:04:39.004
Hurry; go to find Candy and McKinley!

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:41.133
They must have ran away.

00:04:41.283 --> 00:04:44.704
You fool, how could they have ran away
without their luggage?

00:04:44.854 --> 00:04:46.337
Foreman!

00:04:50.918 --> 00:04:52.442
McKinley!

00:04:56.223 --> 00:05:00.455
Where have you been?
Whose hat is that?

00:05:03.197 --> 00:05:09.864
Wait for me, McKinley!
Where are you going, McKinley?

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:17.871
Dr. Kerry...

00:05:18.679 --> 00:05:21.705
Everyone, come and help!

00:05:25.686 --> 00:05:28.951
Be careful!
He has mud all over him.

00:05:40.835 --> 00:05:43.729
That's too bad.

00:05:43.879 --> 00:05:47.763
Change his clothes.
Find something suitable for him.

00:05:48.809 --> 00:05:50.470
Wait.

00:05:50.978 --> 00:05:53.606
I can change the clothes for him.

00:05:53.881 --> 00:05:58.744
Don't worry, Candy.
Can't we help Dr. Kerry?

00:05:58.894 --> 00:06:03.015
To thank him for taking care of us.

00:06:03.165 --> 00:06:05.354
That's right.

00:06:06.027 --> 00:06:08.723
I appreciate it, but...

00:06:12.366 --> 00:06:17.599
Actually... Dr. Kerry is a woman.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:28.273
Candy, he's a woman?

00:06:28.849 --> 00:06:29.709
Yes.

00:06:29.859 --> 00:06:32.252
She's my sister.

00:06:33.087 --> 00:06:35.021
Your sister?

00:06:35.356 --> 00:06:40.753
Please leave the room.
You too, Arthur.

00:06:40.903 --> 00:06:42.021
Sorry, Candy.

00:06:42.171 --> 00:06:43.620
No problem.

00:06:51.305 --> 00:06:52.965
How is it possible?

00:06:53.115 --> 00:06:56.035
To have such a handsome man?

00:06:56.185 --> 00:06:59.238
Ben, didn't you discover anything
when you were staying at the hospital?

00:06:59.388 --> 00:07:03.306
I am losing my confidence.

00:07:05.519 --> 00:07:10.183
But, it's better to have
a female doctor.

00:07:10.491 --> 00:07:13.252
I wish I was injured.

00:07:13.402 --> 00:07:15.821
That is not going to work with Candy.

00:07:15.971 --> 00:07:19.957
That freckled girl is very cunning!

00:07:41.689 --> 00:07:45.284
Dr. Kerry, it's me, Candy!

00:07:47.661 --> 00:07:49.458
Candy...

00:07:50.197 --> 00:07:52.825
Arthur, she's awake!

00:07:54.401 --> 00:07:55.800
Sister...

00:07:57.238 --> 00:07:58.865
Arthur...

00:08:00.141 --> 00:08:02.868
Sister, sorry to make you worried.

00:08:03.018 --> 00:08:06.472
The tithingmen are coming.

00:08:06.622 --> 00:08:11.746
You fell down the valley
because you came to let Arthur know.

00:08:12.453 --> 00:08:15.714
How did the tithingmen know
I'm here?

00:08:15.864 --> 00:08:17.550
Don't let them catch you, Arthur!

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:21.527
I can't run away.
Besides, there is no way out of here.

00:08:21.862 --> 00:08:25.992
Turn yourself in,
it's going to lessen your punishment.

00:08:29.803 --> 00:08:31.361
Mr. Nelson...

00:08:35.843 --> 00:08:38.404
Candy, what's going on?

00:08:38.554 --> 00:08:40.777
What do you mean?

00:08:43.617 --> 00:08:45.676
Don't act like a fool!

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:49.949
This doctor disguised herself as a man
and her brother is a wanted man.

00:08:50.099 --> 00:08:56.827
Candy, you kept this secret from me.

00:08:57.565 --> 00:08:59.192
Mr. Nelson...

00:08:59.466 --> 00:09:01.400
Don't take me for a fool!

00:09:17.418 --> 00:09:21.477
Hey, can't you go faster?

00:09:21.627 --> 00:09:27.286
It was pouring last night.
Be careful or you might fall.

00:09:27.436 --> 00:09:32.355
Don't worry.
There's no way out of here anyway.

00:09:40.441 --> 00:09:41.634
Come, let's go.

00:09:41.784 --> 00:09:44.336
Wait, Mr. Nelson, please!

00:09:44.486 --> 00:09:47.706
I beg you, please don't hand
Arthur to the tithingmen!

00:09:47.856 --> 00:09:54.780
Stop nagging. Let go. Now we know
he's a murderer, we can't let it go!

00:09:54.930 --> 00:09:58.655
Arthur!
Arthur...

00:09:59.126 --> 00:10:00.616
Dr. Kerry!

00:10:01.495 --> 00:10:03.439
Arthur!

00:10:03.589 --> 00:10:04.963
Sister!

00:10:05.199 --> 00:10:08.127
Doctor...

00:10:08.277 --> 00:10:11.603
Mr. Nelson, please give him a chance.

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:15.470
You, go to work!

00:10:33.761 --> 00:10:34.820
Dr. Kerry...

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:40.959
I will swap...
I will swap with Arthur!

00:10:57.384 --> 00:10:59.249
I beg you, guys!

00:11:00.321 --> 00:11:05.017
Please save him. Please!

00:11:05.167 --> 00:11:07.086
I want to help too.

00:11:07.236 --> 00:11:09.588
How can the tithingmen go back
empty handed?

00:11:09.738 --> 00:11:12.791
We will ask the foreman to hide him.

00:11:13.967 --> 00:11:15.958
You are slacking again!

00:11:16.737 --> 00:11:17.963
Foreman.

00:11:18.113 --> 00:11:22.134
Enough. Concentrate on your work
and shut up.

00:11:22.284 --> 00:11:24.837
Let's get this done
as soon as possible.

00:11:24.987 --> 00:11:27.706
Mr. Nelson,
the tithingmen are coming.

00:11:27.856 --> 00:11:31.143
How could they get out
if we don't get the road done?

00:11:31.293 --> 00:11:33.012
Then, Mr. Nelson wants to...

00:11:33.162 --> 00:11:39.151
- Enough! Back to work!
- Work, work, work!

00:11:56.643 --> 00:11:59.203
Margot, prepare two lunch boxes.

00:11:59.446 --> 00:12:02.708
Two lunch boxes?

00:12:02.858 --> 00:12:06.145
Yes, for Dr. Kerry and Arthur.

00:12:06.295 --> 00:12:09.553
Yes, Mr. Nelson!

00:12:16.163 --> 00:12:18.290
Lunch boxes for two?

00:12:18.440 --> 00:12:20.292
Yes, Tiandy!

00:12:20.442 --> 00:12:25.531
Dr. Kerry, Mr. Nelson will help you.

00:12:25.681 --> 00:12:27.933
But the tithingmen will be here soon.

00:12:28.083 --> 00:12:32.968
Dr. Kerry, I will give you a glucose
shot to give you strength.

00:12:40.854 --> 00:12:43.382
Hey, how much further?

00:12:43.532 --> 00:12:47.188
To the end of the rail.

00:12:59.206 --> 00:13:00.733
Almost ready.

00:13:00.883 --> 00:13:04.642
Together, let's push.

00:13:10.651 --> 00:13:13.779
- Damn, we missed it.
- Hurry, let's try again.

00:13:18.692 --> 00:13:22.093
- Watch out!
- Rockslide!

00:13:28.569 --> 00:13:32.266
- We did it, brother.
- We brought us some time.

00:13:43.684 --> 00:13:45.083
What?

00:13:46.453 --> 00:13:49.648
No, that's not big enough.

00:13:49.798 --> 00:13:53.051
So, that's it.

00:13:53.201 --> 00:13:54.753
Right, more dynamite.

00:13:54.903 --> 00:13:58.424
No, more dynamite
would cause a landslide.

00:13:58.574 --> 00:14:00.467
Let's dig it with our hands.

00:14:00.834 --> 00:14:02.795
We must do something.

00:14:02.945 --> 00:14:05.964
Who's that? Maybe the tithingmen?

00:14:17.551 --> 00:14:18.984
Candy!

00:14:19.853 --> 00:14:21.548
I came to help you.

00:14:23.123 --> 00:14:24.817
Is Dr. Kerry OK?

00:14:24.967 --> 00:14:27.588
She is getting better.

00:14:29.696 --> 00:14:31.493
I will get this.

00:14:41.842 --> 00:14:43.605
Here.

00:14:44.111 --> 00:14:45.635
Oh my!

00:14:58.258 --> 00:15:02.319
I didn't expect
I would be doing this here.

00:15:02.496 --> 00:15:04.670
Sir, please carry on.

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:08.131
Wait, look at this.

00:15:10.203 --> 00:15:12.398
It looks like tree bark.

00:15:12.839 --> 00:15:16.366
Someone is up there.

00:15:17.544 --> 00:15:19.171
How come?

00:15:19.321 --> 00:15:22.140
Someone must know we are coming.

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:22.908
Hurry!

00:15:23.058 --> 00:15:25.076
Hurry up!

00:15:45.339 --> 00:15:46.565
We did it!

00:15:46.715 --> 00:15:48.005
Are we through?

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:52.804
I knew we could do it.

00:15:52.954 --> 00:15:58.010
- That's great! Thank you, Ben!
- Don't mention it.

00:16:00.387 --> 00:16:02.821
It's Mr. Nelson!

00:16:04.524 --> 00:16:06.116
Get off here.

00:16:08.095 --> 00:16:10.421
It's Dr. Kerry and Arthur!

00:16:10.571 --> 00:16:15.126
Foreman Bob at the other end of the
tunnel is my friend. He will help you.

00:16:15.302 --> 00:16:16.662
Thank you very much.

00:16:16.812 --> 00:16:20.070
I will turn myself in
when I go back to the city.

00:16:21.541 --> 00:16:24.436
Candy, thank you for your help.

00:16:24.586 --> 00:16:27.973
No, I should thank you guys,
Arthur.

00:16:28.123 --> 00:16:32.344
I will see you, Candy,
if I don't get the death penalty.

00:16:32.494 --> 00:16:34.813
How is that possible?

00:16:34.963 --> 00:16:40.918
- His punishment will be less that way.
- The train is here!

00:16:41.161 --> 00:16:42.952
Hurry!

00:16:43.102 --> 00:16:47.626
Yes. Thank you all.

00:16:47.776 --> 00:16:56.166
- Don't mention it, we were just digging.
- That's our job!

00:16:58.745 --> 00:17:04.809
- Thank you.
- Goodbye, Dr. Kerry, Arthur...

00:17:12.492 --> 00:17:13.452
Where's the clinic?

00:17:13.602 --> 00:17:15.051
There.

00:17:19.533 --> 00:17:21.460
Is Candy in?

00:17:21.610 --> 00:17:22.794
Tiandy?

00:17:22.944 --> 00:17:25.099
No, Candy.

00:17:35.849 --> 00:17:37.783
It seems no one is here.

00:17:39.653 --> 00:17:41.484
Hey, Mr. Nelson!

00:17:44.491 --> 00:17:47.352
What's the matter?

00:17:47.502 --> 00:17:51.171
Are you nurse Candy?

00:17:51.321 --> 00:17:52.955
Yes.

00:17:53.105 --> 00:17:55.727
Do nurses dig tunnels as well?

00:17:55.877 --> 00:17:58.703
We were short of men, you know...

00:17:59.606 --> 00:18:01.164
Let's check this place out.

00:18:01.608 --> 00:18:03.200
Give me the light.

00:18:06.813 --> 00:18:08.140
Mr. Nelson...

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:10.581
We did our best.

00:18:14.721 --> 00:18:16.048
Is this the end?

00:18:16.198 --> 00:18:20.526
Yes, it will take one more month
to get through.

00:18:28.769 --> 00:18:31.430
There is nothing suspicious.

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:33.097
Let's look somewhere else.

00:18:36.676 --> 00:18:43.138
- What?
- He fell!

00:18:47.721 --> 00:18:51.817
I am sorry
that you came for nothing.

00:18:53.193 --> 00:18:56.094
I didn't come for nothing.

00:19:01.501 --> 00:19:02.360
Please.

00:19:02.510 --> 00:19:07.365
What a hardworking nurse,
she even got us coffee.

00:19:07.515 --> 00:19:09.806
Candy, what's wrong with Margot?

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:12.738
She's not well.

00:19:12.888 --> 00:19:16.271
She must remember
what happened three years ago.

00:19:17.617 --> 00:19:19.084
Yes.

00:19:19.386 --> 00:19:21.911
What did she do?

00:19:22.455 --> 00:19:24.753
Margot is a murderer.

00:19:38.939 --> 00:19:40.873
Long time no see, Margot.

00:19:44.578 --> 00:19:48.241
Margot is not a bad person,
there must be some mistake.

00:19:49.349 --> 00:19:51.109
Mother is good person!

00:19:51.259 --> 00:19:53.243
Yes, she is.

00:19:54.821 --> 00:19:59.417
You killed a drunk guy trying to protect
yourself, but it's murder, nonetheless.

00:20:00.093 --> 00:20:07.125
That man was going to hit Belle,
she was still a baby.

00:20:07.275 --> 00:20:08.894
He hit your baby?

00:20:09.044 --> 00:20:10.862
She was too noisy, he was saying.

00:20:11.012 --> 00:20:14.633
Everybody knows you didn't have
the intention to kill him.

00:20:14.783 --> 00:20:17.469
I just wanted to push him away.

00:20:17.619 --> 00:20:22.811
Accidental homicide.
The jury will sympathise with you.

00:20:34.628 --> 00:20:35.854
Mom!

00:20:36.004 --> 00:20:39.457
Belle, your mother has something
important to do.

00:20:39.607 --> 00:20:40.892
I want to go to.

00:20:41.042 --> 00:20:42.935
You can't go.

00:20:46.606 --> 00:20:49.074
- Belle...
- Mother!

00:20:52.445 --> 00:21:05.347
Mother! Mother!

00:21:07.427 --> 00:21:10.919
Belle!

00:21:12.532 --> 00:21:17.262
"Arthur and Margot are both
good people!"

00:21:17.412 --> 00:21:23.276
Candy tells herself again and again
as the train is moving further away.
